      "title": "Avg triage time | متوسط زمن الفرز",
      "description": "Mean wall time of one triage run (sum of its graph nodes). Thresholds: green < 60 s, amber 60-120 s, red >= 120 s: the per-incident time budget is 120 s. No data: the Sentinel has not processed events in this range (no incidents yet, or the service is down).",
